 "id": 1800982,
 "titulo": "11/7 Update Details (Updated)",
 "fecha": 1699347620725,
 "modificada": 1733044476826,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1800982",
 "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1699334452466\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/99260c8b1c134f72bdf1d5887953be6e_1699334452466_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Greetings, Agents.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Higher, further, and faster!<br>\nSuper Heroes with the best Team-Up have come together.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">We introduce the November Update&nbsp;<br>\nin celebration of the release of Marvel Studios’ <em>The Marvels</em>.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Captain Marvel</span>, the protector of the Milky Way, has become stronger with <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Tier-4 Advancement</span>,<br>\n<span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Nick Fury</span> who has improved his abilities as an Agent to lead the team has <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Advanced to Tier-3</span>,<br>\nand <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Ms. Marvel (Kamala Khan) </span>and <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Captain Monica Rambeau</span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">who have equipped a new Uniform have formed a team.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The Marvels will be facing Kree warriors who are willing to&nbsp;<br>\ndestroy numerous worlds to rebuild their empire.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Agents! Enter the <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">&lt;Legendary Battle: Masters of Light&gt;</span><br>\nto check out their battles in the MARVEL Future Fight Universe.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">And there is another battle that cannot be missed!<br>\n<span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Additional high-score rewards for Alliance Battle: Extreme &amp; Legend&nbsp;</span><br>\nand various improvements have been prepared, so don’t miss out!&nbsp;<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Four New Uniforms</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Four new Uniforms have been added<br>\nin celebration of the release of Marvel Studios’ <em>The Marvels</em>.<br>\nCheck out the abilities of Captain Marvel &lt;<em>Marvel Studios’ The Marvels</em>&gt;,&nbsp;<br>\nNick Fury &lt;<em>Marvel Studios’ The Marvels</em>&gt;, Ms. Marvel (Kamala Khan) &lt;<em>Marvel Studios’ The Marvels</em>&gt;,<br>\nand Captain Monica Rambeau &lt;<em>Marvel Studios’ The Marvels</em>&gt;.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* New Uniform Skills are based on the following skill Level stats. (Tier-4 heroes: Lv. 10, Others: Lv. 6) &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br>\n* The four new uniforms will be </span><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">on sale for 50% off during the &lt;November Update Celebration Event&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">,&nbsp;<br>\nand can be checked and purchased in the Marvel Universe and the Uniform Room after the event.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1785\" id=\"1699334667205\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/d215470d974f4224a23b2cd5f177f026_1699334667205_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1277\" id=\"1699334667221\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/89869a7f89b4483a8508ffd302e4e80f_1699334667221_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1329\" id=\"1699334667232\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/f0f7730c984f418d8c4ddbfd32bb6d15_1699334667232_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1469\" id=\"1699334667242\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/6b00217b57ed42918616249f5a1d7651_1699334667242_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Captain Marvel Tier-4</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Tier-4 Advancement has been added to Captain Marvel.<br>\nCheck out her overwhelming presence that shines bright in the dark Universe.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"286\" id=\"1699334723093\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/23dda54d7d514474b800efa402507eda_1699334723093_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ Nick Fury Tier-3</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Tier-3 Advancement has been added to Nick Fury.<br>\nTeam up with this exceptional Agent who has proven his excellence in every battle!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"360\" id=\"1699334742345\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/284b487e123d4d5baa16939ed4783292_1699334742345_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1699334760386\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/ffeee8869ead41d29944d9e6a0f530e6_1699334760386.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ Minn-Erva &amp; Korath Potential Awakening &amp; Transcendence</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Through the November Update, Minn-Erva and Korath</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">will acquire Potential Awakening &amp; Transcendence!<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"819\" id=\"1699334792499\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/68b6a6cf9dc24ef1abf5947bce1f8ffb_1699334792499_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" id=\"1699334802315\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/e012196cd17d42cc97886ac4539f88be_1699334802315.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" id=\"1699334830265\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/c7440565fe554627b63fef2acd5f08cb_1699334830265.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ New Legendary Battle: Masters of Light &nbsp;</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Challenge the Marvel Studios’ <em>The Marvels</em> Legendary Battle and acquire various rewards.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. Acquire Spectrum as 1★ when entering the stage &lt;S.A.B.E.R. Situation&gt;.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- The reward can only be acquired once upon first clearing when Spectrum is not possessed.​</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"434\" id=\"1699334883664\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/29a4e7cd051e4fbfb180f1c564be5a53_1699334883664_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">2. Enjoy Extreme Mode by purchasing the product.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"433\" id=\"1699334896211\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/55a08fef43b842bda369c2ec7c2e57aa_1699334896211_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">- Legendary Battle Extreme Mode effects will be applied right after the product is purchased,<br>\nso please take note that Crystal refunds will not be available.<br>\n- Extreme Mode can be played continuously&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">after purchasing the Legendary Battle Extreme Mode product only once.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">3. The Special Offers product will be shown to Agents&nbsp;<br>\nwho meet certain conditions at the battle preparation screen.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"434\" id=\"1699334924349\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/0d745ddf4cef447e834f4dc75a152b08_1699334924349_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">​4. There are three stages for the new Legendary Battle Normal / Extreme each.<br>\nBonus rewards will be given when completing certain missions.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The following rewards can be acquired when clearing all challenges.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"434\" id=\"1699334963431\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/bf621fce48a34ad29f883cc5b2713c1a_1699334963431_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"674\" id=\"1699334973849\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/11b2f8ab9f2840328bdc8e6257b35877_1699334973849_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Alliance Battle Improvements</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">High-score rewards have been added for the Extreme and Legend modes.<br>\nTrain your skills in Practice Mode to acquire a higher score.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"331\" id=\"1699335064710\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/677d536dd98f413e8168460e36bea1d2_1699335064710_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;* One reward from the components can be obtained based on chance from the&nbsp;<br>\nCollection Token Supply Chest, Tier-3 Material Supply Chest, and Tier-4 Material Supply Chest.<br>\n* Please check the rewards in-game.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">2. Practice Mode has been added for Normal, Extreme, and Legend Mode.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"434\" id=\"1699335090338\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/fd745ee5326f4a088a0eb9c32fc6dd24_1699335090338_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">- There are no entrance limits for Practice Mode,&nbsp;<br>\nbut the participation requirements for heroes are the same as the actual battle.<br>\n- Agents can choose the round when challenging Practice Mode<br>\n- Scores, Rewards, and Challenges achieved when clearing Practice Mode will not be counted.<br>\n- The feature to Continue battle when defeated is not available in Practice Mode.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ New Artifacts</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">New Exclusive Passive Skill Artifacts for Captain Marvel, Nick Fury,&nbsp;<br>\nSpectrum, Minn-Erva, and Korath will be added through the November Update.&nbsp;<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects are based on Lv.4 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1313\" id=\"1699335132285\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/7923ed52517d4e919902651fbfd1f45d_1699335132285_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ New Future Pass Season &amp; Special Icons</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">A new season of Future Pass will begin after the update.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[Future Pass Rewards]</span></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"572\" id=\"1699335159304\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/6a9f1699b8e64df5ae731c545a8974fe_1699335159304_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- Please note that the Future Pass effects&nbsp;will apply immediately upon purchase and cannot be refunded.<br>\n- Legendary / Mythic Future Pass that has been unlocked will only be applied during the season&nbsp;<br>\nthe Pass was purchased, and the Pass rewards will only be available during the same season.&nbsp;<br>\nPlease don’t forget to check the remaining event time.<br>\n- The Mythic Pass can be purchased after purchasing the Legendary Pass.<br>\n- Legendary and Mythic Future Passes will not be available for purchase&nbsp;<br>\nwhen the season is about to end. Please check the sale schedule in the game.</span><br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n​New Special Icons that will represent you have been added.<br>\nCollect two new Icons as Future Pass Rewards,&nbsp;<br>\none as Otherworld Battle rewards, and one more from the upcoming Event!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><strong>[November Update New Special Icon]</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-1a181a2d-7fff-5049-a0a4-7020d4343598\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/GMdti-iK9wh7DNaPMahohaELCHmSCt3NFy_vLPgCwTuDWU1q_w-NYoS_pjvcL2UbpBo19i_vTom2997qunaH_Z2Ogz4oCwNUPKq6HtgGDly4k12YBJto0GJ07Gj20Z-ZiDNto8Ex1rmD\" width=\"150\"></b><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-1a181a2d-7fff-5049-a0a4-7020d4343598\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/u5JYffu9TtC-hRhKVEExvX2TLZZcRXpxspmTnNRDFli7qVScD6rX7jThbDsVlHJHTPmYiTleCXRkXqdc-NxCdsUuIjoa8QtAxiwfm1_aJu8gCG9BNZkssWlpx3oGYcWba6E23h6uHmlY\" width=\"150\"></b><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"> </span></span><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-1a181a2d-7fff-5049-a0a4-7020d4343598\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/Caxkoo-hoAHjoKAG1wDi7S60d1zvQPG3dHUY1ONfb7Pyu3HF6odIRDdALzmTzedKvaDq1ApFLZRIkaM6JSHOS25bVed2A8jWvE0iVtBEXoW2SoJzb-oAh9PwO9jz5YQzrFscXrqWmAsy\" width=\"150\"></b><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-1a181a2d-7fff-5049-a0a4-7020d4343598\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/8I4QZFkTovkwXfqxsnm2FRTYaVh5TaE622yncbL6pgmbJ4_uxYdannp8o4grQfNXx2OClsw6Vbb6GRRR4drAOtfD2FsL-v0VSxEIlx9Is6iAjXNxIaEIi2LuYgLM59lxtGzwVYT64kUA\" width=\"150\"></b><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ New Uniform Collection</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Check out the new Uniforms of Marvel Studios’ <em>The Marvels</em>.<br>\nComplete the collection by achieving the specified conditions and earn a reward.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"434\" id=\"1699335297775\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/59032df4425543098b49450f4807e9d9_1699335297775_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Other Improvements and Changes</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. The alternate reward that can be acquired&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">from the&nbsp;Selector: Tier-3 / Selector: Potential Transcended Character&nbsp;<br>\nwhen selecting a hero that is already owned with the same tier or higher has been improved.</span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- Before: Biometrics of the hero<br>\n- After: Biometrics of the hero + growth materials</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* Please check the details in-game.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"434\" id=\"1699335346483\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/49fda6998cca490297db56259d15651f_1699335346483_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"434\" id=\"1699335346509\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/0e7ed95349a64b63a276cb0ffa708c03_1699335346509_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">2. New items have been added through the November Update.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The acquisition method will be announced through a separate notice.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">[11/7 (Tue) 10:21&nbsp;(UTC+0), 11/7 (Tue) 2:21&nbsp;(PST) added]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:null;\"><font face=\"Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The description for Premium Tier-3 Advancement Ticket has been fixed.</span></font></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099\">[11/14 (Tue) 7:03&nbsp;(UTC+0), 11/13 (Mon) 23:03&nbsp;(PST) added]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:null\"><font face=\"Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Some terms have been adjusted.</span></font></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"723\" id=\"1699945328487\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/0850bd5d55e9476e919255b86227ac89_1699945328487_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">3. Arrow buttons that allow Agents to move through different collection themes&nbsp;<br>\nhave been added to the main screen of each Team-Up Collection theme.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">4. The challenges that are currently in progress will now be displayed&nbsp;<br>\non top of the list when entering each Team-Up Collection theme.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">5. The information on the Collection Token that can be acquired&nbsp;<br>\nwhen increasing the Team-Up option level will now be displayed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">6. A tutorial for the Team-Up Collection has been added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">7. An option to turn off the notice that shows up&nbsp;<br>\nwhen entering Shadowland with less than three heroes in a team has been added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ Game Error Fixes</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. The game restarting when searching for Agents&nbsp;<br>\nwhose account is to be deleted by name at Friends has been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">2. Trial Uniform not being able to be purchased&nbsp;<br>\nwith Uniform Tickets when progressing Guided Quests has been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">3. Challenges on Facebook friends not being counted in certain conditions has been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">4. X of Swords and Team buffs disappearing in Alliance Tournament<br>\nwhen defeated heroes revive in certain conditions has been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">We will return with various content improvements, so please stay tuned.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Thank you.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1699335413223\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/48d2aa3724ac484b98b22e3edd308167_1699335413223_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n"
